--- NNP_1 ---

Reactant->TS1 umbrella-sampling PMF reconstruction (same 'dD' coordinate and window layout as
LFER_3_mg2/pph4/PMF_react_TS1/USW_100_react_TS1/ — see that folder's README) driven with
committee member 'graph_1_004_compressed.pb' as the primary potential: the LAMMPS
'pair_style deepmd' line lists ../NNP/graph_1_004_compressed.pb first (DeePMD-kit's LAMMPS
plugin uses the first-listed graph to drive the dynamics; the other two listed graphs are
only used to compute 'model_devi_pyro.out', the committee disagreement for QC).

o rep_1/, rep_2/, rep_3/: three independent replicas, each with 100 windows (000..099) +
  'inputs/lmp_files/' seed copy + 'COLVAR' + 'WHAM/' (per-replica free-energy reconstruction,
  same file set as described in LFER_3_mg2/pph4/PMF_react_TS1/USW_100_react_TS1/README).
o average_PMF.py / average_pmf.png / average_pmf_noerror.dat: average the three replicas'
  WHAM profiles into a single PMF estimate for this committee member.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
